26e5e622-39e9-4b92-8695-5844dfa9b2fe	iPhone 17 Pro Max 256GB | Chính hãng Việt Nam	intelligent-bamboo-pants-vds-DwZjvC	Apple đã chính thức ra mắt iPhone 17 Pro Max vào lúc 0h00 ngày 10/09/2025 trong sự kiện "Awe Dropping". Flagship dòng Pro cao cấp năm nay đã trở thành “đỉnh cao công nghệ” với hàng loạt cải tiến về thiết kế, hiệu năng mạnh mẽ và công nghệ camera đột phá. Chính vì vậy, iPhone 17 Pro Max 256GB nhanh chóng trở thành chiếc smartphone đẳng cấp và đáng mua nhất năm 2025.Hệ thống ủy quyền chính hãng của Apple tại Việt Nam khám phá lý do vì sao không nên bỏ lỡ siêu phẩm này nhé. 	b7079621-c838-4e4a-a725-7750e2e31c5e	[-0.28348303,0.5732174,-3.1513164,0.029794201,1.163506,-0.6114369,0.5416001,-0.288825,-0.54756135,0.049287643,-0.55657655,-0.5362008,0.910854,0.26104864,0.9259359,-0.68461275,-0.37343985,-0.64974713,-0.30547997,0.80818933,0.21829873,0.192963,-2.2530851,0.23001432,0.9124112,0.38586733,0.7414156,0.70062995,-0.9411079,-0.10061584,1.0471855,-0.2710225,-0.96361834,0.652982,-1.1347916,-1.0205914,0.9492776,0.82718855,0.9225973,1.7982894,0.78628594,0.25476193,0.18413056,0.35675037,0.5508358,-0.00093429035,-0.1586404,0.36664778,1.154813,-1.1581105,-0.06911318,1.3561863,0.20780332,-0.6377215,1.2561291,-0.42059162,0.8347805,0.7147119,-0.50203514,1.200469,0.8036056,0.68337864,-0.8140546,1.2500807,2.0698743,-1.018414,-0.30749974,0.49009827,0.09074366,-0.5712551,0.245401,-1.2314726,-0.6349232,0.039380707,-0.32371467,-0.40273362,-0.92494535,-0.6958329,0.03488683,0.8690157,0.3539634,0.15024301,1.332476,-0.016116237,0.6864156,0.03689043,-0.27838463,0.7916897,-1.3654948,1.4105986,-0.16027708,-0.2382241,-1.0728441,0.31832096,-0.8335671,1.352859,-0.1478097,0.07318808,-0.55914253,-0.02822862,0.43678442,-0.5736064,1.0370524,0.05078444,0.19781749,2.2561188,-0.10190146,0.32483414,-0.84588397,0.17706661,-0.12063479,0.9015932,0.68028563,-0.2984845,0.44632125,0.10211533,1.3866891,-0.09947323,0.21562603,-0.089159235,-0.86001664,-0.14221852,0.7990565,1.0098556,0.065469034,0